are you grateful.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":78,"sd":null},{"k":"23:79","t":"And it is He who has multiplied you throughout the earth, and to Him you will be gathered.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":79,"sd":null},{"k":"23:80","t":"And it is He who gives life and causes death, and His is the alternation of the night and the day. Then will you not reason?","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":80,"sd":null},{"k":"23:81","t":"Rather, they say like what the former peoples said.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":81,"sd":null},{"k":"23:82","t":"They said, \"When we have died and become dust and bones, are we indeed to be resurrected?","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":82,"sd":null},{"k":"23:83","t":"We have been promised this, we and our forefathers, before; this is not but legends of the former peoples.\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":83,"sd":null},{"k":"23:84","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"To whom belongs the earth and whoever is in it, if you should know?\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":84,"sd":null},{"k":"23:85","t":"They will say, \"To Allāh.\" Say, \"Then will you not remember?\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":85,"sd":null},{"k":"23:86","t":"Say, \"Who is Lord of the seven heavens and Lord of the Great Throne?\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":86,"sd":null},{"k":"23:87","t":"They will say, \"[They belong] to Allāh.\" Say, \"Then will you not fear Him?\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":87,"sd":null},{"k":"23:88","t":"Say, \"In whose hand is the realm of all things - and He protects while none can protect against Him - if you should know?\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":88,"sd":null},{"k":"23:89","t":"They will say, \"[All belongs] to Allāh.\" Say, \"Then how are you deluded?\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":89,"sd":null}],"juz":18,"hizb":35,"surahs":[23],"sajdah":false}